{"type":"text","timestamp":1790255909337,"sessionID":"ses_f2c6fada1ffeRMpSR9fs01tTLm","part":{"id":"prt_0d39149c9001wKDGV5x5TtLqNW","messageID":"msg_0d390f18f0010fzWsfnbeVJ76f","sessionID":"ses_f2c6fada1ffeRMpSR9fs01tTLm","type":"text","text":"The project has a single full-screen `MeshInstance2D` using this shader, so the implementation can stay self-contained. I’m using `SCREEN_PIXEL_SIZE` for resolution-independent scanlines, clamping the warped coordinates before sampling, and keeping the outside mask explicit so the curved edges fade to black cleanly.","time":{"start":1790255909321,"end":1790255909324},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0986dac011c1d6c2016ab52319509881979b06dd947914f95e","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790255909356,"sessionID":"ses_f2c6fada1ffeRMpSR9fs01tTLm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_P0U7UwwFURXN90xKX5NVEcFG","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader\n@@\n shader_type canvas_item;\n+render_mode unshaded, skip_vertex_transform;\n+\n+const float CURVATURE = 7.0;\n+const float VIGNETTE_MULTIPLIER = 2.0;\n+\n+uniform sampler2D screen_texture : hint_screen_texture, filter_linear_mipmap;\n \n void fragment() {\n-    COLOR = vec4(1.0);\n+    vec2 centered_uv = SCREEN_UV * 2.0 - 1.0;\n+\n+    vec2 warped_uv = centered_uv;\n+    warped_uv *= 1.0 + CURVATURE * centered_uv * centered_uv;\n+    warped_uv = warped_uv * 0.5 + 0.5;\n+\n+    float screen_mask = step(0.0, warped_uv.x) * step(warped_uv.x, 1.0);\n+    screen_mask *= step(0.0, warped_uv.y) * step(warped_uv.y, 1.0);\n+\n+    vec2 sample_uv = clamp(warped_uv, vec2(0.0), vec2(1.0));\n+    vec4 screen_color = textureLod(screen_texture, sample_uv, 0.5);\n+\n+    float scanline = 0.92 + 0.08 * sin(SCREEN_UV.y / SCREEN_PIXEL_SIZE.y * PI);\n+    float vignette = 1.0 - dot(centered_uv, centered_uv) * VIGNETTE_MULTIPLIER * 0.25;\n+    vignette = clamp(vignette, 0.0, 1.0);\n+\n+    COLOR = vec4(screen_color.rgb * scanline * vignette * screen_mask, 1.0);\n }\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader\n+++ /workspace/screen_effect/screen_effect.gdshader\n@@ -1,5 +1,27 @@\n shader_type canvas_item;\n+render_mode unshaded, skip_vertex_transform;\n \n+const float CURVATURE = 7.0;\n+const float VIGNETTE_MULTIPLIER = 2.0;\n+\n+uniform sampler2D screen_texture : hint_screen_texture, filter_linear_mipmap;\n+\n void fr